{"task_id": "HumanEval/30", "solution": "def get_positive(l: list):\n    \"\"\"Return only positive numbers in the list.\n    >>> get_positive([-1, 2, -4, 5, 6])\n    [2, 5, 6]\n    >>> get_positive([5, 3, -5, 2, -3, 3, 9, 0, 123, 1, -10])\n    [5, 3, 2, 3, 9, 123, 1]\n    \"\"\"\n    if l is None:\n        return []\n    positives = []\n    for item in l:\n        # skip booleans which are subclasses of int\n        if isinstance(item, bool):\n            continue\n        try:\n            if item > 0:\n                positives.append(item)\n        except TypeError:\n            # ignore non-comparable / non-numeric items\n            continue\n    return positives"}
